              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "I cannot directly book or reserve a physical parking spot for you, as I don\u2019t have access to your personal information, vehicle details, or payment methods. \n\nHowever, I can help you find the best parking options, rates, and booking platforms. To point you in the right direction, **which city and country are you in?**\n\nDepending on your location, here are the best apps and websites you can use to reserve or pay for a spot tomorrow afternoon:\n\n### \ud83d\udccd If you are in Romania:\n*   **AmParcat:** A highly popular app across Romania for finding and paying for parking spots quickly via card.\n*   **TPARK:** Works in over 80 Romanian cities (including Bucharest, Cluj-Napoca, Timi\u0219oara, Bra\u0219ov, etc.) and allows you to easily pay for parking via SMS or card.\n*   **UPPARK:** Great for finding available parking spaces and paying digitally in major Romanian cities.\n*   **Parking Bucure\u0219ti:** The official app if you are looking for parking specifically in the city center of Bucharest.\n*   **Interparking Romania:** Excellent for securing underground or secure gated parking garages in central Bucharest.\n\n### \ud83c\udf0d If you are elsewhere in Europe:\n*   **JustPark / Parkopedia:** Excellent for finding and pre-booking street parking, private driveways, and parking garages in the UK and Europe.\n*   **EasyPark:** Widely used across most of Western and Central Europe.\n\n### \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 If you are in the US or Canada:\n*   **SpotHero** or **ParkWhiz:** These are the premier apps for reserving guaranteed spots in city centers and garages in advance.\n\n**How to proceed:**\nIf you reply with your **target city**, the **approximate street or landmark** you want to park near, and your **estimated timeframe**, I can search for the nearest garages, their rates, and provide direct links where you can book them!",
